# Gitignored files worth carrying into a new worktree (see `wt step copy-ignored`).
# A file is copied only if it is BOTH gitignored AND matched here.

# Rust build cache: makes the first `maturin develop` in the worktree incremental
# instead of a cold build of the whole dependency graph.
target/

# Python environment: pillow, numpy, pyyaml and maturin, so setup works offline.
# The binding inside it points at the primary worktree and is relinked by the
# post-start hook; see scripts/setup_worktree.sh.
.venv/

# Harness inputs that cannot be re-derived from the repository.
# Source decks are third-party and deliberately untracked.
render-improvement-harness/decks/*/source.pptx
# LibreOffice reference renders: slow to regenerate, and the harness compares
# against them rather than reproducing them, so reuse keeps runs comparable.
render-improvement-harness/decks/*/lo-img/
